{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash is a simple 2D platformer adventure game where you play as a duck named Scruffles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique levels</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash contains 10 unique levels with increasing difficulty and length (and their own easter eggs).</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished Player Movement</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Duck has polished player movement that makes it fun to play whether you have never played a platformer game or if you are an experienced player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash can be played at any pace, whether fast or slow.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrunning Mode</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash contains a speedrunning mode so you can see the time it took for you to complete a level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both local leaderboards and global leaderboards, so you can race other Steam users or local times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts are recorded for global leaderboards, so you can see your friends ghosts while racing them.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Xbox Controller Support</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash is fully playable with an Xbox controller.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Also, Scruffles is cute)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Golden Duck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3961540/10f7a9011f9b2d6ca9a8a76606d01162854592de.jpg"},{"name":"Didn't even Sweat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3961540/f81801bd3c49c9eee9212ec6f92a4da1522b6764.jpg"},{"name":"Don't give up Scruffles!","